 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Reincarnated in a Cursed Game"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "망겜으로 기사회생"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "An overworked game developer dies and is reincarnated as the weakest character in the game he created himself. Challenged by Jaeseokcheon, the ruler of the game universe, he must complete a series of quests to survive and prevent a second death. Epic battles between monsters, celestial beings with magic powers, and Jaeseokcheon ensue. In this tug-of-war between the omniscient game designer and the hidden mastermind ruler… Who will win?"
  },
